    <entry>
      <title>在clojure中用函数式方法计算1+2+..10</title>
      <link href="/2026/11/18/functional-sum/"/>
      <url>/2026/11/18/functional-sum/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>1+2+..10代表了一类问题。在面向过程语言中，通常这样来计算1+2+..10：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// for</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> acc = <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> i = <span class="number">1</span>; i &lt;= <span class="number">10</span>; i++) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    acc += i;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">// while</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> acc = <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> i = <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">while</span> (i &lt;= <span class="number">10</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    acc += i;</span><br><span class="line">    i += <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>执行流程是，首先执行初始化<code>acc = 0, i = 1</code>，然后检查迭代/循环结束条件<code>i &lt;= 10</code>，如果没有结束，每次循环都会执行不变式<code>acc += i; i += 1</code>，直到<code>i &gt; 10</code>。<br>在每次循环中，我们用<code>i+1</code>和<code>acc+i</code>计算出一个新值再通过赋值去修改<code>i</code>和<code>acc</code>。<br>这里的<code>i</code>和<code>acc</code>就像在草稿纸上的两个数，我们先拿到纸上“当前”<code>acc</code>和<code>i</code>的值，然后计算新的值，再擦除旧值，把新的数写上去。</p><h2 id="递归"><a href="#递归" class="headerlink" title="递归"></a>递归</h2><figure class="highlight clojure"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">(<span class="keyword">defn</span> <span class="title">sum</span> [acc i]</span><br><span class="line">  (<span class="name">println</span> `(<span class="name">sum</span> ~acc ~i))</span><br><span class="line">  (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">if</span></span> (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">&lt;=</span></span> i <span class="number">10</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">recur</span></span> (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">+</span></span> acc i) (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">inc</span></span> i))</span><br><span class="line">    acc))</span><br><span class="line">(<span class="name">sum</span> <span class="number">0</span> <span class="number">1</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>我们定义了一个函数<code>sum</code>，可以被复用（在这里是被自身调用），在函数体中，<code>recur</code>关键字等同于<code>sum</code>（就像对象方法中的<code>this</code>）。<br>同样，我们定义了一个不变式<code>(if ...)</code>，在<code>(&lt;= i 10)</code>为真时，则执行调用<code>sum</code>，于是形成了循环的效果。如果<code>i</code>大于<code>10</code>，将直接返回<code>acc</code>的值并不再调用<code>sum</code>，则循环结束。<br>初始化的地方是在第一次调用<code>(sum 0 1)</code>，它让<code>acc=0,i=1</code>。在每次迭代中，我们计算出新的<code>acc</code>和<code>i</code>的值，但这里我们这里没有去“修改”变量的值。<br>而是就像第一次调用<code>sum</code>那样，进行一次新的调用：<code>(sum 1 2)</code>，来初始化一次局部变量<code>acc</code>和<code>i</code>，后续不会修改它们。<br>对于上面描述的这个过程，可以想象有10张纸，我们不会擦除每一张纸上的<code>acc</code>和<code>i</code>旁边写着的数，而是在新的纸上写下新的<code>acc</code>和<code>i</code>的数。（实际上，尾递归优化会复用旧的纸，但不妨碍我们进行那样的推理）<br>注意到sum函数中有一行<code>(println `(sum ~acc ~i))</code>，<code>(sum 0 1)</code>执行结果如下：</p><figure class="highlight clojure"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">(<span class="name">sum</span> <span class="number">0</span>  <span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line">(<span class="name">sum</span> <span class="number">1</span>  <span class="number">2</span>)</span><br><span class="line">(<span class="name">sum</span> <span class="number">3</span>  <span class="number">3</span>)</span><br><span class="line">(<span class="name">sum</span> <span class="number">6</span>  <span class="number">4</span>)</span><br><span class="line">(<span class="name">sum</span> <span class="number">10</span> <span class="number">5</span>)</span><br><span class="line">(<span class="name">sum</span> <span class="number">15</span> <span class="number">6</span>)</span><br><span class="line">(<span class="name">sum</span> <span class="number">21</span> <span class="number">7</span>)</span><br><span class="line">(<span class="name">sum</span> <span class="number">28</span> <span class="number">8</span>)</span><br><span class="line">(<span class="name">sum</span> <span class="number">36</span> <span class="number">9</span>)</span><br><span class="line">(<span class="name">sum</span> <span class="number">45</span> <span class="number">10</span>)</span><br><span class="line">(<span class="name">sum</span> <span class="number">55</span> <span class="number">11</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">55</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>对于这类迭代计算过程，在SICP课程中，是用一个叫<code>add</code>的函数来解释的，在计算的方式上，它实际上与我们的<code>sum</code>做的事情是相同的：</p><figure class="highlight clojure"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">(<span class="keyword">defn</span> <span class="title">add</span> [x y]</span><br><span class="line"> (<span class="name">println</span> `(<span class="name">add</span> ~x ~y))</span><br><span class="line">  (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">if</span></span> (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">=</span></span> x <span class="number">0</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    y</span><br><span class="line">    (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">recur</span></span> (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">dec</span></span> x) (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">inc</span></span> y))))</span><br><span class="line">(<span class="name">add</span> <span class="number">3</span> <span class="number">4</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><img src="/2026/11/18/functional-sum/sicp-iteration.png" width="50%" title="迭代"><p><code>(add 3 4)</code>执行结果如下：</p><figure class="highlight clojure"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">(<span class="name">add</span> <span class="number">3</span> <span class="number">4</span>)</span><br><span class="line">(<span class="name">add</span> <span class="number">2</span> <span class="number">5</span>)</span><br><span class="line">(<span class="name">add</span> <span class="number">1</span> <span class="number">6</span>)</span><br><span class="line">(<span class="name">add</span> <span class="number">0</span> <span class="number">7</span>)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">7</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="loop"><a href="#loop" class="headerlink" title="loop"></a>loop</h2><figure class="highlight clojure"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">(<span class="name"><span class="built_in">loop</span></span> [acc <span class="number">0</span> i <span class="number">1</span>]</span><br><span class="line"> (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">if</span></span> (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">&lt;=</span></span> i <span class="number">10</span>)</span><br><span class="line">  (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">recur</span></span> (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">+</span></span> acc i) (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">inc</span></span> i))</span><br><span class="line">  acc))</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>loop 是上面的<code>sum</code>的简化写法。<code>(sum 0 1)</code>和定义参数放在一起写变成了<code>[acc 0 i 1]</code>。</p><h2 id="loop-集合"><a href="#loop-集合" class="headerlink" title="loop 集合"></a>loop 集合</h2><figure class="highlight clojure"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">(<span class="name"><span class="built_in">loop</span></span> [acc <span class="number">0</span> i (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">list</span></span> <span class="number">1</span> <span class="number">2</span> <span class="number">3</span> <span class="number">4</span> <span class="number">5</span> <span class="number">6</span> <span class="number">7</span> <span class="number">8</span> <span class="number">9</span> <span class="number">10</span>)]</span><br><span class="line"> (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">if</span></span> (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">not</span></span> (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">empty?</span></span> i))</span><br><span class="line">  (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">recur</span></span> (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">+</span></span> acc (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">first</span></span> i)) (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">rest</span></span> i))</span><br><span class="line">  acc))</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>我们这里只是将<code>i</code>的历史值序列替换成了集合。</p><h2 id="reduce"><a href="#reduce" class="headerlink" title="reduce"></a>reduce</h2><figure class="highlight clojure"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">(<span class="name"><span class="built_in">reduce</span></span> + (<span class="name"><span class="built_in">range</span></span> <span class="number">1</span> <span class="number">11</span>))</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>就对于本问题的类似问题而言，不需要写模板代码，而是通过调用库函数<code>reduce</code>，<code>reduce</code>抽象了<code>loop</code>、遍历集合，初始化、不变式。需要填空reduce参数即可，只需要极少的代码。</p><p>至此为止，我们消除了<code>for</code>、<code>while</code>、变量<code>acc</code>和<code>i</code>，和对它们的<em>mutation</em>。<br>这样做的好处是，避免关注繁多细节，从而避免犯错的机会。</p>]]></content>
      
      
      
